### Terraform ###
# Local plan/state files (deploy/aws/terraform/ uses a local backend until
# "Continuous deployment" in deploy/aws/README.md moves it to S3).
**/.terraform/
**/.terraform.lock.hcl
**/terraform.tfstate
**/terraform.tfstate.backup
# Not secret, but reveals the AWS account id via the state-bucket name
# (deploy/aws/terraform/github_oidc.tf's tfstate_bucket/tfstate_dynamodb_table
# vars) - generated locally per README.md, and by CI from repo variables.
**/backend.auto.tfvars
